Sat Nov 14 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of pgModeler 2.0.0 Community edition as pgmodeler2,
  installable next to pgmodeler (1.2.x), which keeps the database
  import, diff and SQL tools that 2.0 moved to the paid Plus edition
  * Build with GCC instead of the hard-coded clang
  * Update check disabled (updates come from the package)
  * Executables live in %{_libdir}/pgmodeler2, with pgmodeler2 and
    pgmodeler2-cli symlinks in %{_bindir}, so the $ORIGIN RUNPATH
    points at a library directory; the unversioned private sonames
    are kept out of Provides/Requires
  * Add a .desktop entry and icon; the .dbm MIME type comes from the
    pgmodeler package
  * Translations in a -lang subpackage
